BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nervous System Reset Yoga with Alicia
DTSTART:20261108T000000
DTEND:20261108T000000
DTSTAMP:20261108T173323Z
UID:40c8837425e7e2577b223af6d0b569@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join Alicia for a 2 hour special event! The Nervous System Res
 et includes guided meditation\, intuitive movement\, over an hour of yin y
 oga\, thirty minutes of sound healing and group energy healing. You will l
 eave feeling more present\, relaxed\, and embodied. Yin Yoga is a beginner
  friendly\, meditative practice where we hold grounded poses for three to 
 five minutes. This allows for the fascia\, connective tissues and the mind
  to soften through stillness and mindful breathing. Yin Yoga encourages yo
 u to slow down\, turn inward\, and create space for both physical and ment
 al well-being. Meet Alicia! Alicia's yoga journey began 13 years ago\, whe
 n the first time she stepped on a mat was the first time\, she felt presen
 t in her body. That experience grew into a passion for helping others find
  their own connection. Since then\, she has completed 500+ hours of yoga t
 rainings\, sound healing certificates and 10 years of learning energy heal
 ing through Navajo traditions. She is continuously learning and embodying 
 the teachings. She is looking forward to offering this event to her commun
 ity as a local herself. You can also find Alicia at Union Street Yoga as w
 ell as River and Stone! Please bring your own mat Sources: Discover Centra
 l Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nervou
 s-system-reset-yoga-with-alicia/31127/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles 
 of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-e
 vents.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nervous-sy
 stem-reset-yoga-with-alicia/31127/
LOCATION:Barn at Blackstone National\, 227 Putnam Hill Road\, Sutton\, MA
 \, 01590
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nervous-system-reset-yoga-with
 -alicia/31127/
END:VEVENT
