BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Poiesis Quartet
DTSTART:20261108T000000
DTEND:20261108T000000
DTSTAMP:20261108T173323Z
UID:e212a4eb778f08dfb521b23d94b7fd@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Founded only in 2022\, the Poiesis Quartet has already become 
 a much-talked-about force in classical music. On Sunday\, November 8\, the
 y tackle two landmarks of the repertoire—Ludwig van Beethoven's final st
 ring quartet (a work full of good humor despite having been written in try
 ing circumstances) and Sergei Prokofiev's String Quartet No. 1. They also 
 bring two recent works: Many Many Cadences\, a bright and brilliant work b
 y Sky Macklay\, and Tapestry of the Beloved Beatified\, a new commission f
 rom Jeff Scott\, founding horn player of Imani Winds. The Poiesis Quartet 
 was named among the best classical performances of 2025 by The New York Ti
 mes. The Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum’s Fall 2026 Weekend Concert Ser
 ies features a ten-concert autumn season curated by Abrams Curator of Musi
 c George Steel held on select Sundays at from September 13 through Novembe
 r 22\, 2026. The fall season showcases world-class artists in the Museum
 ’s extraordinary Calderwood Hall—a 300-seat “sonic cube” with thre
 e levels of balconies designed so that 80% of seats are front row\, creati
 ng a uniquely intense and intentional listening experience. Dating to 1927
 \, the Gardner’s Weekend Concert Series is the longest running museum mu
 sic program in the country. Learn More/Get Tickets Sources: Meet Boston Ev
 ent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/poiesis-quartet/92817/\n\nEvent
 s Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fa
 llback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.
 com/event/poiesis-quartet/92817/
LOCATION:Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum\, Isabella Stewart Gardner Museum
  Calderwood Hall 25 Evans Way\, Boston\, MA\, 02115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/poiesis-quartet/92817/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Run4Veterans 5k Road Race/Walk
DTSTART:20261108T000000
DTEND:20261108T000000
DTSTAMP:20261108T173323Z
UID:caa70f2bad58d80bec05979c28bbc9@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:About This Event: We are excited to invite you to participate 
 in the 2026 Run4Veterans 5k Road Race/Walk with Veterans Inc. at Polar Par
 k! We look forward to a fun morning of activity in support of Veterans and
  their families in need. Registration begins at 8am. Help us do more for t
 he Veterans we serve while enjoying the home of the Woo Sox! Run to win\, 
 walk for fun\, but most importantly sign up and have fun for a good cause!
  All Fitness Levels and Strollers Welcome! All Pre-Registrants will receiv
 e a commemorative event running shirt\, and all participants will enjoy fo
 od\, beer\, music\, prizes\, and more after the race. If you can’t make 
 it in person this year\, we are offering a virtual sign-up option as well!
  Just run a 5k before the deadline\, submit your times\, and we will recog
 nize your participation and honor the virtual winner alongside the in-pers
 on honorees. Rep your branch or wear your Red\, White\, & Blue. Packet Pic
 kup Options: Stay tuned for packet pickup details on the Veterans Inc. web
 site and social media channels! Event Shirts: Event shirts will be distrib
 uted at race packet pickup or on race day while supplies last. Awards Cere
 mony: An awards ceremony will begin at 11:30am at Polar Park. We have a wi
 nner’s podium and trophies for the top 3 placements in each category. We
  encourage all to gather and participate in this exciting portion of the p
 ost-race festivities! Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: 
 https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/run4veterans-5k-road-race-walk/306
 94/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscove
 ry: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www
 .discovercentralma.org/event/run4veterans-5k-road-race-walk/30694/
LOCATION:Polar Park\, 100 Madison St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/run4veterans-5k-road-race-walk
 /30694/
END:VEVENT
