 rlier works and ushered in his late style. Saint- Saëns’ Quartet is rhy
 thmically dynamic\, jaunty in tone\, energetic\, and exuberant. Sunday\, N
 ovember 8 @4:00 PM Jeanne Y. Curtis Hall* Assumption University 500 Salisb
 ury Street\, Worcester *located in the Tsotis Family Academic Center Pre-c
 oncert talk @3:30 PM Program Bohuslav Martinů: Three Madrigals\, H.313 Lu
