UID:5316a41070056020f395a478236f68@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Step Up. Speak Out. Create Change. Different Shoes\, Shared St
 eps\, One Community. Join us for an interactive opportunity to show your s
 upport\, stand up for what matters\, and take action toward creating posit
 ive change. This event will help participants build greater understanding
 \, empathy\, and respect. Participants are invited to walk one lap around 
 the track\, taking time along the way to read and reflect on survivor stor
 ies. This shared experience is an opportunity to raise awareness\, honor s
 urvivors\, and remind one another that every voice and every action can ma
 ke a difference. Content Warning: Survivor stories may include description
 s or references to sexual violence. Please take care of yourself and parti
 cipate in whatever way feels comfortable for you. --- Event Details: https
