DESCRIPTION:After back to back tours around the world\, The Rock Orchestra
  returns to the USA with a brand new show! Igniting the flames of legendar
 y Rock & Metal songs with the help of pyro displays and fire performers\, 
 The Rock Orchestra presents its epic new spectacle: Arena of Fire. Prepare
  for a spellbinding 90-minute concert\, as 14 classical musicians breath b
 eautifully dark energy into iconic songs. Performing the music of iconic b
 ands including: Metallica\, AC/DC\, Rolling Stones\, My Chemical Romance\,
  Linkin' Park\, SOAD\, Guns N Roses\, Evanescence\, Papa Roach\, The Cranb
 erries & MORE! Witness the electrifying fusion of Classical music and Meta
 l in a show that burns with beauty & intensity. The Rock Orchestra is a ro
 tating collective of classical musicians that features some of the world's
  greatest instrumentalists and vocalists To purchase tickets please visit 
 Ticketmaster or the DCU Center Box Office. Disclaimer: The Rock Orchestra 
 and its events are not affiliated with the artists and composers listed. A
 ll trademarks are the property of their respective owner Sources: Discover
