BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Club 321 featuring Mark Mandeville & Raianne Richards
DTSTART:20261112T000000
DTEND:20261112T000000
DTSTAMP:20261108T173323Z
UID:4d9c81bc4590671580dfa79b1682b0@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Artist: Mark Mandeville & Raianne Richards Join us at Club 321
  for an evening of heartfelt storytelling\, rich harmonies\, and authentic
  folk/Americana music with Mark & Raianne. Returning after a packed-house 
 performance last year\, this beloved husband-and-wife duo brings back thei
 r unmistakable vocal blend and down-to-earth stage presence for another in
 timate night at Club 321. Known for their rich harmonies and poetic songwr
 iting\, Mark & Raianne weave together original music and traditional acous
 tic instrumentation—including guitar\, mandolin\, banjo\, harmonica\, uk
 ulele\, clarinet\, and penny whistle—to create a sound that is both inti
 mate and expansive. With more than seventeen albums recorded in their firs
 t decade together and extensive touring throughout the U.S. and Canada\, t
 heir performances balance thoughtful\, poetic songwriting with moments of 
 humor\, connection\, and community. Deeply rooted in Central Massachusetts
 \, the duo are also founders of the Massachusetts Walking Tour\, an annual
  initiative that combines outdoor exploration with free community concerts
  to celebrate local green spaces and connection through music. This is a p
 erfect Club 321 evening for listeners who value storytelling\, acoustic be
 auty\, and music that feels close to home. Experience a different side of 
 Mechanics Hall\, in our intimate Washburn Hall\, transformed one Thursday 
 night a month into your favorite club. Come sip handcrafted drinks from ou
 r full bar\, and enjoy cabaret-style seating. An unforgettable evening in 
 the heart of downtown Worcester! ADDITIONAL INFORMATION Tickets: $30 Mecha
 nics Hall Members: 10% discount off single ticket Time: Doors 6:15pm | Sho
 w 7:00pm Cash bar and refreshments available for purchase Sources: Discove
 r Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/even
