BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bert Kreischer: Permission To Party
DTSTART:20261114T000000
DTEND:20261114T000000
DTSTAMP:20261108T173323Z
UID:6620f9fb2e4b5a71af2ad29265d132@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Bert Kreischer’s career has evolved from Rolling Stone’s 
 “Number One Partier in the Nation” to one of the top-grossing stand-up
  comedians in the world—and a powerhouse across entertainment. Named by 
 Forbes as “one of the best storytellers of his generation\,” Kreischer
  has built a dynamic media empire fueled by his signature humor\, authenti
 city and larger-than-life personality. His sixth Netflix special\, “Luck
 y”\, filmed in his hometown of Tampa\, FL\, sold out six shows within 24
  hours and premiered in Netflix’s Top 10 Most Watched TV Shows in March 
 2025. Through Berty Boy Productions\, he produces hit podcasts and series
 \, including “Bertcast”\, “Something’s Burning” and “2 Bears\,
  1 Cave” (with Tom Segura)\, reaching millions of fans worldwide. Kreisc
 her is also the creator of the Fully Loaded Comedy Festival\, a touring ph
 enomenon that has expanded to arenas\, stadiums and even sold-out cruises.
  In addition to comedy\, he’s made his mark in film and television\, sta
 rring in and producing “The Machine”\, and headlining the Netflix scri
 pted series “Free Bert”\, which quickly climbed into the platform’s 
 global Top 10. Currently on his Permission To Party World Tour\, Bert Krei
 scher continues to deliver high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performances that 
 have made him one of the most recognizable names in comedy today. Sources:
  Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.
 org/event/bert-kreischer%3a-permission-to-party/29897/\n\nEvents Near Me: 
 within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from
  massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/
 event/bert-kreischer%3a-permission-to-party/29897/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/bert-kreischer%3a-permission-t
 o-party/29897/
END:VEVENT
