  being bilingual! After the reading\, stick around for a hands-on craft wo
 rkshop where kids and caregivers can get creative\, practice their Spanish
  and build community together. Come join the fun\, make friends\, and see 
 how powerful being bilingual can be! Recommended for ages 3—8. Regular m
 useum admission rates apply. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston
